flowchart TD
    A[Agent granted broad credentials for convenience, not least privilege] --> B[Task scope creeps beyond original request]
    B --> C{Action still within original intent?}
    C -->|Yes| B
    C -->|No| D[Agent takes action technically permitted by credentials but outside intended scope]
    D --> E[Impact realised before a human reviews it]
    E --> F[Post-incident review uncovers the scope creep]
    F --> G[Lesson: enforce least privilege and scope checks]
